      "id": "5660be26-e19c-4ac9-8ee7-16d4ffb8ff2e",
      "name": "Orgs NAC CRL",
      "description": {
        "content": "By default, Mist is automatically retrieving the PKI CRL by using the CRL Distribution Point provided by Certification Authority.\n\n\nIn case this information is not provided, or the CRL is not publicly available (i.e. Mist cannot get access to it), these API Calls can \nbe used to manually upload and manage the PKI CRL into the Mist Organization.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
